# Player Actions
+ Notifies player when inventory is full (#2)
: Alerts only activate with inventory changes (ie. lore changes, stack changes)
+ Uses protection measures from WorldGuard flags (#10)

# Mining
+ Implements mining requirements for blocks based and tools used __PR__
+ Mined blocks lookup drops from a drop table and configured with chances __PR__

# Changelog
+ Adds Changelog handling for both the plugin and the server (#3)
+ Adds /changelog command for viewing changelogs (#3)

# Misc / Dependencies
+ Uses paperweight dependency for easier packet Handling
+ Adds plugin tasks used for listeming for events and packets (#11)

# Registration
+ Implements registration for items, blocks, and other features (#9)
+ Introduces ComponentContainer and CompoundKey API for flexible data handling __PR__
+ Refactors item builders to use new CompoundKeys system __PR__
+ Template resources now copy from JAR on initial load __PR__
+ Registers blocks & items from plugin's data folder __PR__
